  "historyNote": "#5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; ss by #8735, eff 10-18-06; ss by #10801, eff 5-17-15; ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.19); renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.21), eff 12-1-25",
