  "prefLabel": "Per 102.25 Compensation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.25 “Compensation” means a schedule of pay for a major group, as defined in these definitions, or any subset of a major group, established in accordance with RSA 99, consisting of a minimum through maximum rate of pay for each pay band established for a major group. The term includes “pay.”\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; ss by #8735, eff 10-18-06; ss by #10801, eff 5-17-15; ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.19); renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.21), eff 12-1-25",
